  "2026-08-09T22:09:40.190Z","harness:codex","Evidence: missing required custom fields now produce typed field-specific recovery options across progressive and strict creation, reusing the SDK policy contract. Focused create tests and full coverage pass."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T22:09:40.872Z","harness:codex",Structured validation errors should carry schema field names and expected types so agents can recover without a separate schema lookup.
